{"id":"n25632-2-7","stage":4,"title":"고르다 · 平顺","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25632-2-7-1","ko":"휴가 잘 다녀왔어요?","zh":"假期玩得还愉快吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔어요?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔어요","audio":"/audio/061149a81c5ed6a290a3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c01156e9476ee50e390.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25632-2-7-2","ko":"여행지 날씨가 고르지 못해 감기에 걸려 고생했어요.","zh":"旅游地的天气很不稳定，我因此感冒了，受了不少罪。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행지","meaning":"旅游地点，旅行地","explanation":"여행지：旅游地点，旅行地","readings":[{"term":"여행지","audio":"/audio/86532e69c59636193d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70722","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행지","audio":"/audio/86532e69c59636193d79.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"고르지","meaning":"平顺，平稳","explanation":"고르다：平顺，平稳；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"고르다","audio":"/audio/68f72f1020d14395ff22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25632","senseId":"2","lemma":"고르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고르지","audio":"/audio/c6324c42c0fe58b8a42a.mp3"}},{"text":"못해","meaning":"不，未能","explanation":"못하다：不，未能；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26841","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못해","audio":"/audio/70b07f24bea552d391a8.mp3"}},{"text":"감기에","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기에","audio":"/audio/b758d0ed4f382a0f8653.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려","audio":"/audio/794467180c643d4431c1.mp3"}},{"text":"고생했어요.","meaning":"吃苦，受罪","explanation":"고생하다：吃苦，受罪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고생하다","audio":"/audio/0318d8c9b3cc667ef643.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62499","senseId":"1","lemma":"고생하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고생했어요","audio":"/audio/6671d8acc47c64a9389b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86532e69c5963619","term":"여행지","zh":"旅游地点，旅行地","audio":"/audio/86532e69c59636193d79.mp3","entryId":"70722","definition":"去旅行的地方。","pronunciation":["여행지"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"68f72f1020d14395","term":"고르다","zh":"平顺，平稳","audio":"/audio/68f72f1020d14395ff22.mp3","entryId":"25632","definition":"天气、音程等的状态变化不大，很正常。","pronunciation":["고르다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不，未能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26841","definition":"表示无法到达之前的话所指的状态。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"0318d8c9b3cc667e","term":"고생하다","zh":"吃苦，受罪","audio":"/audio/0318d8c9b3cc667ef643.mp3","entryId":"62499","definition":"经历痛苦或困难艰苦的事。","pronunciation":["고생하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/285210885f04df98f4a8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25632","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2035,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["旅游地的天气很不稳定，我因此感冒了，受了不少罪。","假期玩得还愉快吗？","妈妈怎么不吃呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["假期玩得还愉快吗？","妈妈怎么不吃呢？","旅游地的天气很不稳定，我因此感冒了，受了不少罪。"],"answer":2}]}
